<title>UK: LVM says Grand Met statement adds nothing.</title>
<headline>LVM says Grand Met statement adds nothing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>French LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton said on Friday that the statement issued by Britain's Grand Metropolitan and Guinness slamming LVMH's demerger proposal &quot;adds nothing of value to the situation&quot;.</p>
</text>
